<title>UK: Sweden sets 3.0 billion French franc Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets 3.0 billion French franc Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and Caisse des Depots et Consignations.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDEN</p>
<p> AMT    3.0 BLN FRF   COUPON     6.625     MATURITY    24.OCT.08</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.376   PAY DATE    30.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.726    SPREAD	+17 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/AA+   LISTING    PARIS/LUX PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.35	SELL CONC  1.65	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.50 PCT OAT DUE 2008</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
